  "version": "1",
  "text": "You look composed and dignified in this ensemble, carrying the gravity of the morning with a quiet grace. The navy suit provides a solid, respectful foundation, while the camel coat offers a gentle warmth without overwhelming your frame. Even though the shoes and outerwear are slightly softer in tone than strict mourning calls for, their elegance keeps the overall impression restrained rather than flashy.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Wear the navy blazer with the collar standing up to sharpen your silhouette.",
    "Leave the coat unbuttoned over the suit so its rich texture contrasts softly with the deep blue."
  ],
